@startuml
title Quote Management - creating a Quote, optionally based on an Agreement

actor "Account Manager" as AM
participant "Product Order Capture & validation\nTMFC002" as POCV
participant "Party Management\nTMFC028" as PM
participant "Agreement Management\nTMFC039" as AGM
participant "Product Configurator\nTMFC27" as PC
participant "Product catalog\nTMFC001" as PCAT
participant "Service Qualificaiton\nTMFC009" as SQ

activate AM
AM -> POCV : Create new Quote for Account
activate POCV
POCV -> POCV : Create new Quote\nfor the customer
POCV -> PM : Update Quote against Account: TMF632 -Party Management API
activate PM
PM -> PM : Update Party with Quote ID\nand status
PM --> POCV : Success Acknowledgment
deactivate PM

POCV -> PC : Configure PO = SD WAN custom solution - TMF 760 - Product Configuration management
activate PC
PC -> PCAT : Fetch PO = :TMF 620 -\nProduct Catalog\nManagement
activate PCAT
PCAT --> PC : Consume the PO with\nthe default configuration
deactivate PCAT
PC -> PC : <color:red>Create Configuration session</color>

group Is Quote based on Agreement? [Yes]
    PC -> AGM : Fetch Agreement details: TMF 651 - Agreement Management
    activate AGM
    AGM --> PC : Consume Agreement details
    deactivate AGM
end

PC -> PC : Update configuration with Agreement
PC --> POCV : Consume the Quote configuration
deactivate PC
deactivate AM

POCV -> POCV : <color:red>Map Configuration\n<color:red>session to the Quote</color>
POCV -> SQ : Conduct Service Feasibility for geographic site = service location: TMF 645 - Service Qualification
activate SQ
SQ --> POCV : Consume the service Qualification results for the service location
deactivate SQ
POCV -> POCV : Apply Service Qual results to the\ndefault configuration

POCV -> PC : Apply the Servie Qual results to  the configuration: TMF -679 Product Offering  Qualification
activate PC
PC -> PC : Config within the Agreement params
PC --> POCV : Consume the configuration f
deactivate PC
deactivate POCV

activate POCV
POCV -> POCV : Save and close Quote
deactivate POCV

@enduml
